WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.533
The customer said yes: contract, payment schedule and job.

00:00:05.233 --> 00:00:09.000
Open the estimate. The one the customer accepted.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.667
Won. Press Won when they accept: on the phone, by email or in person.

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:23.733
One step makes it all. The contract, the payment schedule and the job, with a work item per section. Tick the add-ons they took.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:30.867
Create the job. Press it when it's real: the job then waits on the Schedule. The tour doesn't press it.

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:36.967
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
